<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian soccer matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo championship</p>
<p> Botafogo-Ribeirao Preto 0  Corinthians		   2</p>
<p> Palmeiras		   1  Sao Paulo		     0</p>
<p> Juventus		    3  Rio Branco		    3</p>
<p> Portuguesa		  2  Portuguesa Santista	 2</p>
<p> America-S.J.Rio Preto   1  Uniao Sao Joao		4</p>
<p> Santos			4  Mogi Mirim		    2</p>
<p> Sao Jose		    3  Internacional Limeira     3</p>
<p> Guarani		     0  Aracatuba		     0</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points)</p>
<p>Group One</p>
<p> Palmeiras		12  8  4  0 35 12 28</p>
<p> Santos		   12  6  4  2 21 14 22</p>
<p> Portuguesa	     12  5  5  2 30 21 20</p>
<p> Guarani		  12  4  5  3 23 27 17</p>
<p> Juventus		 12  3  4  5 23 26 13</p>
<p> Sao Jose		 12  2  5  5 18 28 11</p>
