<p> Rio Branco	     12  2  6  4 15 20 12</p>
<p> Aracatuba		12  2  4  6 11 18 10</p>
<p> Portuguesa Santista  12  2  4  6 13 21 10</p>
<p>Note: The teams play once against the other teams in their own group, then twice against the teams in the other group. At the end of this, the top two teams in each group qualify for the play-off stage. If teams are level on points, positions are decided by the number of games won.</p>
<p>Rio de Janeiro championship, first stage final</p>
<p> Botafogo		    1  Vasco da Gama		  0</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>The winners of the first stage, second stage and third stages qualify for the final play-off.</p>
